#: scenario2:scenario2_D22FE458_8A7D_4673_90FE_7646580B8285
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8679c72b2aa8802ae5caac8c1b1cc91369b3a1c9c43f07a48c654ce90433b6a
#. default-sha256: 57eb676c740866f37d82e6225517a0404497445efa249e1f6804051793cc7908
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D22FE458_8A7D_4673_90FE_7646580B8285"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His psyche drifted erratically between human and beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫――彼の精神は、⟪k:4⟫人か獣かの間で彷徨っていました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_613DC2C4_840E_4A8F_9D57_5CAB67B354D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03c8fbb7f300ca0daeb44f43c83a574c7254f3ba71b79e19cf281fa9686d9070
#. default-sha256: 12e82a62c4feea111403eec004ebad10f5657422b169815ed8d185d048781325
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_613DC2C4_840E_4A8F_9D57_5CAB67B354D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he accepted himself as human, it might cause memories better left buried to return to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もし人と認めるのであれば、⟪k:1⟫紐解いてはいけない記憶が蘇るかもしれない。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4E8DBE94_0F0F_455E_BD75_60909F199278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7ee56f0f428a854939201805cbe086ef6b3e79e6e52f4e7ad110965bc9f9f30
#. default-sha256: d624a97e6e4228e9e3c25548c8e0f4cd47e61e1fdaa8e3535515844ccc6963a3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4E8DBE94_0F0F_455E_BD75_60909F199278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he accepted himself as a beast, in exchange for his memories,⟪k:1⟫he would no longer be "
"able to rejoin human society."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もし獣と認めるのであれば、⟪k:1⟫記憶を捨てられる代わりに、⟪k:2⟫人の世には戻れない。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_27E0A2EF_2853_4A32_A306_7FD78DEF8BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f88fe5972fdf68328489052382df85df8d130bb57e62558ec0b56cc884527c7
#. default-sha256: d1cde36d98e0f2152a3a8806b89ee3da753007cdd7511e2666ec71e2702543e9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_27E0A2EF_2853_4A32_A306_7FD78DEF8BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl fervently supported him in these precarious times."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘は、⟪k:1⟫そんな不安定な彼を根気よく支えましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_85DB32B0_F282_4C4F_AADE_25DF44D1793A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99b86d63f61db41e348c6753f159f5db522c8933d0c962fc2fd9b45759344fa5
#. default-sha256: 85087f68b54a43a398ddc53cff584a3c41e41b5a0d4fadabc94faf30cb3e2a71
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_85DB32B0_F282_4C4F_AADE_25DF44D1793A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was quite amazed. ⟪k:1⟫I had never imagined she would grow to be such a strong woman."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくし驚きました。⟪k:1⟫彼女がこんなに強くなっているとは思いませんでしたから。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_81BAC672_0240_4367_B8F1_AEEE5EF63437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d13de436f092fb194a551dcb1423f8b1f1665410bb14be768069d406050368fd
#. default-sha256: 4bce649402688a4d9b81a234165ad2026b6566d7cc5fccf1499f61083f643f33
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_81BAC672_0240_4367_B8F1_AEEE5EF63437"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, God is a cruel master. ⟪k:1⟫For what strength He gave her spiritually, He took "
"in equal part from her physically."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫神様はいじわるですね。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫精神が強くなったとしたら、⟪k:4⟫今度は、⟪k:5⟫肉体が"
"弱まるのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_05F0A744_A738_48CE_AC4F_1752BD288946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 048475af9b92727952d6a71838bdae037c7b605691ab8824e3840246e3a4f10f
#. default-sha256: 836ba637ca5cec58eaa083ae5f46b8ec07530c7e27e589d161f5a4b4730ff4f7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_05F0A744_A738_48CE_AC4F_1752BD288946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she persisted, day in and day out, to stay by the man’s side, one day, she suddenly "
"fell ill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫辛抱強く男の傍にいた娘ですが、⟪k:1⟫ある日突然、⟪k:2⟫倒れてしまったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_634710E0_4271_494D_8734_B73C81AB4A91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2fae264fe5185760dcc1eece2390760f7aac8a3133260b71776d9b30628532c
#. default-sha256: cadfa535f45dc8a839b8ce2783ab21777f4a98afa9195506061ca56010149e6b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_634710E0_4271_494D_8734_B73C81AB4A91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With her in the throes of a high fever and not knowing the cause, he fell into a perpetual "
"panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫原因不明の高熱が彼女を襲い、⟪k:1⟫男は、⟪k:2⟫うろたえるばかりでした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3AE81AF8_72E6_46B9_87D7_D2F4F26D2594
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e18aab0b8ed7425a2037dfe9436d5385f11a78891a14b50691b9ba906c435a8
#. default-sha256: d34a9653ef6590c5c9d374574c23f56cf4a59664c03b17b30e5c748ec3635092
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3AE81AF8_72E6_46B9_87D7_D2F4F26D2594"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was no medicine in the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫They could hardly manage to put together "
"sufficiently nutritious meals."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫屋敷には薬になるものがありません。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫栄養の高い食事すらままならないのですから。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_86C68658_873A_40A0_944A_3AFF8C8C15F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5b38e8be9bf24702c53dace7553147d484b5131101f7de674cbeedfe5eb4b05
#. default-sha256: 1e88a54f50e59eeb0ffb085c68450041922aac994467a13ec36f67bf122123d4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86C68658_873A_40A0_944A_3AFF8C8C15F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though there was no medicine, maybe there was something else that could make her feel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫薬でなくても、⟪k:1⟫せめて、⟪k:2⟫彼女を元気にさせる何かがあれば……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_781579D4_483E_40FE_AF37_18A0F7978D13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0968cad24a4d7af2b8477e49fbcd57b9e7c70938156fdb9c29cf7bebe967724c
#. default-sha256: ff75030bedeb2d88ef957d91271617283f662a282930b0b5e7a0de510c8f8f34
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_781579D4_483E_40FE_AF37_18A0F7978D13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, everything he could think of required him to leave the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう思った男ですが、⟪k:1⟫やはり、⟪k:2⟫それは外でしか手に入らない物だらけなのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF92B370_1B1F_450C_8CEE_E0A7058049B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 468433813f3a2e2ac054d23dad466eeaa4dccf7b7d71f1b3042d880bef2383b7
#. default-sha256: b09cf917940ed099a91ae5699307fe0701a72cfb06232645bb9e0ab52e9259b5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF92B370_1B1F_450C_8CEE_E0A7058049B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Hey... ⟪k:10⟫Hey."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫おい……、⟪k:10⟫おい。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3270703E_D7AD_4458_8C31_65257D00792F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97347f721bb05602466d0df761353ab8368efac4d1e3940d735c576ea4b10c43
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3270703E_D7AD_4458_8C31_65257D00792F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_001F0AE2_2F0B_404C_AA1A_D785C93AA9B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b7b532e31c253a84b57daeaddd594d0d11c7851b6d756be810518f6bf15cc06
#. default-sha256: fdc183d556d2dad68a16cda15450f3c99b71d3aa0bf042afa7100a4090485e17
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_001F0AE2_2F0B_404C_AA1A_D785C93AA9B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Is there anything you would like?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫何か……欲しいものはないか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A0151887_D25E_4A14_BE0E_3B9B75139582
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca41e21418c009799004ff60bf74eddc81018c22161abf9a38e15332eaaa90ab
#. default-sha256: 6ab4e3e7464dad0710a26eef61638c6a3a4e698eaa8f805581c6e4398d60816f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A0151887_D25E_4A14_BE0E_3B9B75139582"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Anything... ⟪k:2⟫I would like...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫欲しい……⟪k:2⟫もの……？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_675D2378_B607_43CE_8DAB_78E22BDD345D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ccc81d85b3662fb4f6911b6d7d318a50c930b57a09a997ae7457c57a0852e5e
#. default-sha256: 777725afc613a493a4d382390d37da1a5c00fd0f422045c0085db94b82ae6c64
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_675D2378_B607_43CE_8DAB_78E22BDD345D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m considering..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫村に……………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4C48DE42_33E8_45EB_82F7_FCF9CFA52535
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a23c86b90cc7c6b4be281cb9bebb78d6d9de40569f3efe07bb30385a6e21358
#. default-sha256: 3c5617e7d411668b326c4e9b3a54c996038ec1ebe9d092db6e52fdccbc2ed0e5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4C48DE42_33E8_45EB_82F7_FCF9CFA52535"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫visiting the village."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……行こうと……、⟪k:2⟫思う。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5AA70BC1_FCF0_46EF_9164_F66F9D0A6DA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 417df228d891d1ceb67de07624f71a67bbbc7afc789b451e3ec6faf8a38ad98b
#. default-sha256: 067b45a79590292e0f0e3f973c5f2ab167a67cb7204f62343fc273c9d359b656
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5AA70BC1_FCF0_46EF_9164_F66F9D0A6DA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I see...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re going to the village..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そうですか……、⟪k:2⟫村に………行かれるのですね………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0E72AAEA_BFA9_466B_AAC8_843C1EAB28C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a11c1efcd0aeab5ff2d7c40384a7876e1d9aeff79ba4dcb106544b2ddd06c15c
#. default-sha256: 0ab8997fbf53267f299e2905afdbe59cf93138ef58a637384cea1af04da21586
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0E72AAEA_BFA9_466B_AAC8_843C1EAB28C9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I thought I might be able to get some medicine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫薬があればと思って………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_31BBE612_F46E_46E3_8340_8AC43F461A39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 066f41898e28f8c56f81390364fae272eaadd1f88db53d569419c1ffd2ed55f9
#. default-sha256: c80fb1d7e49b5d9a8bb277c936e895e57d2f48c7492fc88cd826a4e697edd5f5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_31BBE612_F46E_46E3_8340_8AC43F461A39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would prefer to bring a doctor here...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but no one would come if they learned you "
"were in this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫医者を呼べれば良いのだが……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫屋敷の話をすれば、⟪k:3⟫来るわけがない。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4837F3A8_618A_4A41_8BCA_9F65184841C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d5bb7dcffd4a434107ffad1b253ae82969b09cdd18df7a21b4a3c7d6fdc18e6
#. default-sha256: ccdc212059bd89587e7f6833044bcf86c064d46e2199c0238e79a1356727e224
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4837F3A8_618A_4A41_8BCA_9F65184841C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫だから………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BF0A6369_E0B3_4637_8924_C2EC4BCA7C2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad025d518dc870e233c3caabedf1da5f2e34a2c3647fb5659d002e353ed4e948
#. default-sha256: c25bc58d3bf13c673ccd1be7b11be7360fc4a6e7738b22f3f615191d30286493
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BF0A6369_E0B3_4637_8924_C2EC4BCA7C2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was planning to put on a disguise—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to enter the village as a person."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫男は、⟪k:1⟫身分を偽って――⟪k:2⟫つまり人として、⟪k:3⟫村に降りようと思っておりました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7C2E41D3_243D_485A_BD38_AD1A0ADB69D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c4d71bfe7b7b462487ffb0a10f37bace475c42430bc16a371e9f99665a8b75d
#. default-sha256: 150718db23666d7052e2480d20ab521bf5c451017d8a7b74eb99c94ae7d80e36
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7C2E41D3_243D_485A_BD38_AD1A0ADB69D8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl smiled when she heard his idea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この提案に、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘は微笑みました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C3594EDB_5862_465C_8F1E_DE54E325F513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14271e784edcc62f152719caccebd574cbda4a9aeb23914986b1f0e465e03c1c
#. default-sha256: 1151e12e28ea69ad2816f7af3c6be648f7d7f15903a5bfe3d65a3600b92c183f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C3594EDB_5862_465C_8F1E_DE54E325F513"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, always wanted him to think of himself as human."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女はずっと、⟪k:1⟫彼に人としての自覚を持ってほしいと思っていたのですから。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_70401842_E177_492C_93E8_5FA5249EBE4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e74c4701dd6f05807cb8ae232a31eb33c5a0d645d9fb7f3623e89b3fb983880
#. default-sha256: d243f178cfefb8dc1089c1405460a20f06e43e54f5d4554948d053ee1d09a7f9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_70401842_E177_492C_93E8_5FA5249EBE4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, because she was so pure-hearted, she did not comprehend..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫彼女は善良であり過ぎたために――理解していなかったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_46DD207F_F77B_462E_AE51_E870377CD651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db59be6834aa768b8a64193dbad6b97ecc01f358424a77f64ef180b46c2eadac
#. default-sha256: 756a1aec3933bef1efabdcc32c074c75b465e9247898f831fe76d937657c51ea
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_46DD207F_F77B_462E_AE51_E870377CD651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the full extent of the slaughter he had confessed to committing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫男が告白した殺戮が、⟪k:1⟫実際にはどれほどのものであったのか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_05DDE8BA_3870_4B45_BA3C_233D3FC7144F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 548cdf41a40449b6e8b5f738309c50a279542330a42d44999960063ba6a2d37e
#. default-sha256: f3e3e3dcaad4da71d0a8a6cd00e8ff0d94506e2298a4561c64c0fef6df9ef8df
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_05DDE8BA_3870_4B45_BA3C_233D3FC7144F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The revenge he had taken on those who had chased him around.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How sinister his "
"cackling and furious his reaping."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫村人に追い回された男が行った、⟪k:1⟫復讐……。⟪k:2⟫その激しさを、⟪k:3⟫その禍々しさを、⟪k:4⟫彼が"
"歓喜の声を上げながら残忍に人々を殺した事実を――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_571DB84B_714D_4092_9951_39A38108CD82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9aae9a643856a9aa8889a570f069a95b958351b4a6750dc02f76f81d8df95851
